{"id":"661961","name":"凉拌海带虾滑","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/661961/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"海带","amount":"适量"},{"name":"虾滑","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"柠檬","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小米辣","amount":"适量"},{"name":"辣椒面","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"海带提前泡发备用。","img":"images/661961/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"蒜头小米辣洗净切细。","img":"images/661961/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"香菜洗净切段。","img":"images/661961/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"柠檬用盐搓洗后洗净切薄片，去除柠檬籽。","img":"images/661961/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中水烧开舀入虾滑球。","img":"images/661961/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"煮至定型断生后捞出。","img":"images/661961/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入海带，煮开断生。","img":"images/661961/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煮好的虾滑和海带放入盆里。","img":"images/661961/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入蒜末和小米辣。","img":"images/661961/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入粗细辣椒粉。","img":"images/661961/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入适量盐。","img":"images/661961/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"淋上热油激发出香味。","img":"images/661961/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"挤上柠檬汁。","img":"images/661961/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"加入适量陈醋。","img":"images/661961/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放入香菜。","img":"images/661961/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放入柠檬，搅拌均匀即可。","img":"images/661961/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661961/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661961/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661961/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}